      steps:['Open the menu and tap Security check.','Read each line. A green tick means it is protected, an exclamation mark means there is something to do.','Under Automatic sign out choose how long Pesa waits before it signs people out.','If sign in locks after wrong tries, look in the Activity log to see who was trying.','Make a backup from Settings now and then.'],
